   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1"><text:bookmark-start text:name="finalité-des-fonctions-communes"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc866_1582195625"/>Finalité des fonctions communes<text:bookmark-end text:name="finalité-des-fonctions-communes"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc866_1582195625"/></text:h>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="le-contexte-une-suite-de-plug-ins-coopérants"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc868_1582195625"/>Le contexte : une suite de plug-ins coopérants<text:bookmark-end text:name="le-contexte-une-suite-de-plug-ins-coopérants"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc868_1582195625"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">CMGS (<text:span text:style-name="T1">Concrete Music Gran Studio</text:span>) est une suite de plug-ins pour REAPER, destinée à la composition et à la diffusion de musique concrète. Elle comprend principalement :</text:p>
   <table:table table:name="Table1" table:style-name="Table1">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table1.A" table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    <table:table-header-rows>
     <table:table-row>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Plug-in</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Rôle</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
     </table:table-row>
    </table:table-header-rows>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="T2">GamePlayer</text:span> (le <text:span text:style-name="T1">Game Master</text:span>)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">génération et ordonnancement du jeu des clips, interface principale, exécution des scripts</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P4">FilePlayer</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">lecture des fichiers sonores, pilotée par le Game Master</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P4">ScriptMaster</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">édition, mise au point et exécution des scripts mSL</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P4">Interstys</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">lignes à retard fractionnaires modulaires (lignes, lecteurs, écrivains, effets)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P4">Diffusion-3</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">spatialisation sur un grand nombre de haut-parleurs (projecteurs, scènes, morphing)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="T2">MIDI_In</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="T2">MIDIduino</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">entrée de commandes MIDI et de capteurs vers le Game Master</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="P4">GMAuxiliary.eel</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table1.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">script REAPER (ReaScript) qui réalise pour les plug-ins ce qu’ils ne peuvent pas faire eux-mêmes</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Ces plug-ins sont écrits en <text:span text:style-name="T2">JSFX</text:span>, le langage d’effets de REAPER (fondé sur EEL2). Ils fonctionnent ensemble : le Game Master commande les lecteurs, les scripts peuvent agir sur tous les plug-ins, et les informations circulent de l’un à l’autre.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="ce-que-jsfx-ne-fournit-pas"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc870_1582195625"/>Ce que JSFX ne fournit pas<text:bookmark-end text:name="ce-que-jsfx-ne-fournit-pas"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc870_1582195625"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">JSFX est conçu pour des traitements audio simples. Il impose des contraintes fortes à un ensemble de cette taille :</text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="L1">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P5"><text:span text:style-name="T2">une mémoire plate</text:span> : un tableau de nombres (<text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mem[]</text:span>), sans structures, sans allocation dynamique, sans libération ;</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P5"><text:span text:style-name="T2">des chaînes de caractères numérotées</text:span>, en nombre fixé à la compilation ;</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P5"><text:span text:style-name="T2">pas de multitâche</text:span> : seulement les sections exécutées par REAPER (<text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">@init</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">@slider</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">@block</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">@sample</text:span> dans le fil audio, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">@gfx</text:span> dans le fil graphique, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">@serialize</text:span>) ;</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P5"><text:span text:style-name="T2">une interface graphique rudimentaire</text:span> : quelques primitives de dessin et la souris ;</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P5"><text:span text:style-name="T2">pas d’accès à REAPER</text:span> (projet, pistes, actions) ;</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P5"><text:span text:style-name="T2">une seule zone d’échange entre plug-ins</text:span>, la mémoire partagée <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">gmem[]</text:span>, elle aussi plate ;</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P5"><text:span text:style-name="T2">des fonctions qui doivent être définies avant d’être utilisées</text:span>, et aucun mécanisme de modules.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="la-finalité-du-socle-commun"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc872_1582195625"/>La finalité du socle commun<text:bookmark-end text:name="la-finalité-du-socle-commun"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc872_1582195625"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Les fonctions communes construisent, au-dessus de JSFX, l’environnement dont chaque plug-in a besoin, une fois pour toutes et de la même façon pour tous :</text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="L2">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P6"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Gérer la mémoire</text:span> comme dans un langage moderne : blocs typés, allocation statique pendant l’initialisation, allocation dynamique ensuite, et récupération automatique des <text:soft-page-break/>blocs devenus inutiles (ramasse-miettes).</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P6"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Gérer des chaînes de caractères dynamiques</text:span>, allouées, libérées et récupérées.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P6"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Offrir un langage de script</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="T2">mSL</text:span> (<text:span text:style-name="T1">micro Script Language</text:span>) : un compilateur et un interprète intégrés à chaque plug-in, qui permettent de programmer le comportement de l’ensemble sans modifier les plug-ins eux-mêmes.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P6"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Exécuter plusieurs tâches</text:span> : processus (<text:span text:style-name="T1">threads</text:span>) mSL, ordonnanceur de tâches datées, événements et messages entre processus.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P6"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Faire communiquer les plug-ins</text:span> : organisation de la mémoire partagée, échange de valeurs et de chaînes, journal commun, temps partagé, et accès à REAPER par le script GMAuxiliary.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P6"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Fournir une interface graphique commune</text:span> : thèmes, menus, pads, curseurs, onglets et panneaux de modules, affichages système (journal, mémoire, processus), écran <text:span text:style-name="T1">Live</text:span>.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P6"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Rassembler les utilitaires</text:span> : fichiers, chemins du projet, configuration, édition de valeurs, journalisation et contrôles d’intégrité.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Grâce à ce socle, un nouveau plug-in de la suite hérite immédiatement de toutes ces capacités, avec la même apparence et le même comportement que les autres.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="les-grandes-familles-de-fonctions"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc874_1582195625"/>Les grandes familles de fonctions<text:bookmark-end text:name="les-grandes-familles-de-fonctions"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc874_1582195625"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Les fonctions communes se trouvent dans le répertoire <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">GM-Libs</text:span>. Elles se regroupent en sept familles.</text:p>
   <table:table table:name="Table2" table:style-name="Table2">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table2.A" table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    <table:table-header-rows>
     <table:table-row>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Famille</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Fichiers principaux</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Rôle</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
     </table:table-row>
    </table:table-header-rows>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Mémoire</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_StM_Memory</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_Dyn_Memory</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_Garbage_Collector</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_Dbg_Memory</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">blocs typés, allocation statique et dynamique, ramasse-miettes, inspection</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Chaînes</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_Strings</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_string_list_*</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_gmem_Strings</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">réserve de chaînes, allocation, chaînes échangées par la mémoire partagée</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Langage mSL</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_Constants</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_Comp_lib</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_Evaluator</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_Extend</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_DeAsm</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_GM_Vars_Access</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_FR_Vars_Access</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">compilateur, interprète, extensions, désassembleur, accès aux variables JSFX</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Exécution</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_Scheduler</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_Threads</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_Events</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">ordonnanceur, processus mSL, événements et messages</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Communication</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_clip_map</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_clip_lib</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">clip_lib_MIDI</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">GMAuxiliary.eel</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">carte de la mémoire partagée, échanges entre plug-ins, MIDI, accès à REAPER</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Interface</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">ui-lib</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">ui-lib-JJ-GUI</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_ui_LibJJ</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_ui_Menus</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_ui_Pads</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_ui_audio</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_Panes</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_show_Utilities</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_Live_Screen</text:span>, <text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_Colors</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">bibliothèque graphique et ses extensions, onglets et panneaux, affichages système</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Utilitaires</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents"><text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_Utilities</text:span>, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">mSL_Utilities2</text:span></text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table2.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">fichiers, chemins, verrous, journal, tris, contrôles</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">La bibliothèque graphique de base, <text:span text:style-name="Source_5f_Text">ui-lib</text:span>, est celle de Geraint Luff ; les autres fichiers sont propres à CMGS.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="qui-utilise-quoi"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc876_1582195625"/>Qui utilise quoi<text:bookmark-end text:name="qui-utilise-quoi"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc876_1582195625"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_paragraph">Les cinq grands plug-ins utilisent l’ensemble du socle ; MIDI_In n’en utilise que la partie nécessaire à son interface et à sa communication avec le Game Master.</text:p>
   <table:table table:name="Table3" table:style-name="Table3">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table3.A"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Table3.B" table:number-columns-repeated="6"/>
    <table:table-header-rows>
     <table:table-row>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table3.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">Famille</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table3.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">GP</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table3.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">FP</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table3.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">SM</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table3.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">IN</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table3.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">D3</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
      <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table3.A1" office:value-type="string">
       <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Heading">MI</text:p>
      </table:table-cell>
     </table:table-row>
    </table:table-header-rows>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table3.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Mémoire statique et chaînes</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Table3.A1" office:value-type="string">
      <text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">oui</text:p>
